license: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Abolfazlrwm/sokhan"
url: "https://abolfazlrwm.github.io/sokhan/"
abstract: >-
  Sokhan is a self-hostable, Persian-first speech-to-text toolkit: a
  FastAPI service with a faster-whisper streaming engine, a Celery
  worker, a Persian RTL Next.js dashboard and a Telegram bot. Accuracy
  is published as reproducible WER/CER measurements on a fixed Common
  Voice (fa) fixture shipped with the repository, and a LoRA
  fine-tuning pipeline adapts Whisper to Persian speech.
keywords:
  - persian
  - speech-to-text
  - whisper
  - asr
  - self-hosted
  - reproducibility
